The module interface is FIXED and must be used exactly as-is (do not rename the module or any port). You must output the complete module code, starting with the `module` keyword and ending with `endmodule`, including all port direction and width declarations:

```verilog
module TopModule(clk, reset, load_en, data_in, count_out);
